Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GWPHydrodynamics", "Title",
 CellID->1201420376,ExpressionUUID->"f997287b-3a6d-4868-be32-ab5a15a40672"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPHydrodynamics package acts as a master orchestrator for Quantum Fluid \
Dynamics extensions within the GWPTools framework. It dynamically loads the \
appropriate subpackages based on the currently active GWP engines. For \
example, the 1D extension implements 1D quantum fluid dynamics, energy \
partitioning, and exact analytical Bohmian trajectories. A complete reference \
of the underlying mathematical definitions, Madelung transformations, and \
C-Space mappings is provided in the final appendix.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9986601534157953`*^9},
 CellID->1909480458,ExpressionUUID->"bebb1c16-e473-47b5-b002-65b2ae92e228"],

Cell["\<\
Future development will focus on expanding support to multi-dimensional \
(2D/3D) hydrodynamic flow, superposition states, and visualizing trajectory \
flows for additional time-dependent external potentials.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998660176472657*^9, 3.9986602031898212`*^9}},
 CellID->642436838,ExpressionUUID->"b2e27378-ba15-4519-a5bf-ad8f5dbb4b0b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Initialization", "Section",
 CellID->2076505803,ExpressionUUID->"e39adb3e-78f9-41af-a245-ad4b8bac2947"],

Cell["\<\
To evaluate the examples in this technical note, load the core package, the \
relevant wavepacket engine, the hydrodynamics orchestrator, and the developer \
context to expose the backend symbolic evaluators.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998660217128871*^9},
 CellID->1076283624,ExpressionUUID->"dd7c0472-d8dc-4abe-8a6b-d75b4d4ae6de"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Load the primary package, initialize the required engines and hydrodynamics \
extension, and expose the developer context.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->844109887,ExpressionUUID->"7ae75a65-086f-44f4-aba3-1beda4b48dc9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPEngine1D`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPHydrodynamics`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPDeveloper`\>\"", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9986602263389673`*^9, 3.9986602265960627`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->677898727,ExpressionUUID->"366aea94-f42e-4c80-be09-c8ce1fad2942"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Frontend Registration & Introspection", "Section",
 CellID->1043157354,ExpressionUUID->"79e3f1a9-9e4c-4c29-bebe-8189e224e1df"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPHydrodynamics orchestrator dynamically registers several specialized \
property classes to the active engine. For the 1D engine, it appends \
hydrodynamic expectation values to the existing ExpectationValues class, \
while introducing dedicated classes for spatial fields, momentum fields, and \
Bohmian trajectories.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998660249189508*^9},
 CellID->289154570,ExpressionUUID->"73f16b70-efa6-47f2-b600-1688b6718ed8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Query the frontend dispatcher to list all currently registered property \
classes for the 1D wavepacket type.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998660257034896*^9},
 CellID->65364829,ExpressionUUID->"4a70b962-f806-405f-8630-f8b79c9f1c23"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Classes\>\"", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:=",
 CellID->1222537386,ExpressionUUID->"81364780-3c85-4351-a5d5-f9032424ec1f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"BohmianTrajectories\"\>", ",", "\<\"DynamicParameters\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"Energies\"\>", ",", "\<\"ExpectationValues\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"HydrodynamicsP\"\>", ",", "\<\"HydrodynamicsX\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"Probabilities\"\>", ",", "\<\"StaticParameters\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"Wavefunctions\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0004129394658537`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[5]=",
 CellID->677316490,ExpressionUUID->"247d8dc2-3238-4ea9-9a15-ea6fb5d97e80"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Hydrodynamic Expectation Values", "Subsection",
 CellID->62312006,ExpressionUUID->"da7727dc-5548-4012-83cc-d9c7bf459f25"],

Cell["\<\
This extension augments the base ExpectationValues class with energy \
partitioning observables, such as internal and convective kinetic/potential \
energies, as well as Fisher information metrics.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998660291702779*^9},
 CellID->1453348753,ExpressionUUID->"385a55b7-a9a5-4af2-bb3c-a7e2bd8f8b41"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Inspect the usage records for hydrodynamic expectation values.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->953490693,ExpressionUUID->"aa081886-5fcc-4cec-83fb-bf4548bd49cc"],

