Cell["\<\
Bohmian coordinate trajectories are generated by mapping the inverse error \
function (InverseErf) across the cumulative probability domain. Higher-order \
derivatives utilize a specialized recursive polynomial generator \
(GWP1DInverseGaussianEngine).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2014431201,ExpressionUUID->"5e4dc572-1a8f-4d5a-a0b7-860f51740217"],

